      "displayName": "",
      "value": "Advanced kick rejoin watchdog:\n\nThis macro waits in an idle state until you are kicked or disconnected, then rejoins.\nIt is always-on so it can keep watching after server changes.\n\nEdit these components:\nEDIT Kick Filter: use any, or a reason like restart, transfer, kicked.\nEDIT Rejoin: delay and optional server IP.\nLoop Wait: pause before watching again.\n\nLeave Rejoin server IP blank to use the last server. Put a server IP in field 2 to force one server.",
